# FIR module-first Python preprocessing dependencies (Python 3.12).
# FIR modules provide Python, NumPy, pandas, SciPy, GDAL and mpi4py.
# IMPORTANT: netCDF4 is intentionally omitted: setup_nwam_fir.sh builds
# netCDF4 1.7.4 against FIR's SERIAL NetCDF/HDF5, preventing a Rasterio
# import-order conflict seen with the wheelhouse's MPI-linked netCDF4 wheel.
# Base package versions were tested on FIR on 2026-10-30.
